    {
      "id": "a117-q10",
      "type": "single",
      "difficulty": "hard",
      "stem": "**Ši knyga įdomesnė už mane.** What case is *mane*, and why?",
      "options": [
        "Nominative, matching *ši knyga*.",
        "Accusative after *už* in the *than* construction.",
        "Genitive after *už* meaning *behind*.",
        "Dative, because comparisons need a recipient."
      ],
      "correct": 1,
      "explanation": "¶119: *už* + accusative = *than*. The same preposition with the genitive means *behind*. With *negu* one would say *negu aš*, matching nominative.",
      "rulesTested": [
        "comparison-negu",
        "pronouns-cases"
      ],
